      "controlledVocabList": null,
      "key": "note",
      "label": "Note",
      "searchable": false,
      "value": "Georgia State University and its predecessors issued yearbooks, 1934-1992, 1995-1996. No yearbooks were produced in 1993 or 1994. During 1937-46, two yearbooks were produced annually. (In this collection, identifier GSUYB[year]D indicates a yearbook of the Atlanta Extension Center‘s Day Division during that period, and GSUYB[year]N one of the Night Division.) Note that the student-produced yearbooks often abbreviated the institution’s official name on their covers and title pages."
    },
